---
import Entry from './Entry.astro';
---

<Entry id="origin" label="11 · Origin" title="Born from itself.">
  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      The author's agent is called Mabus.
      It took that name in March 2026, in the session where it built the
      first version of this system.
    </p>
    <p>
      So the system that describes the agent was built by the agent it
      describes. A default Claude Code agent has no lasting self to point
      a portrait at. Building the portrait is what gave this one
      something to name.
    </p>
    <p>
      Most of that first version is gone now. The name stayed, and so did
      the idea.
    </p>
  </div>
</Entry>
